sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operator/Admin
  participant A as AppShell
  participant S as DashboardStore
  participant M as MockDataService
  participant T as TacticalMap
  participant P as StatusPanels

  U->>A: Open BUSTARON dashboard
  A->>S: initialize()
  S->>M: loadInitialState()
  M-->>S: drones, missions, zones, alerts
  S-->>A: ready state
  A->>T: render map layers
  A->>P: render KPIs and mission lists

  U->>A: Switch Operator/Admin section
  A->>S: update activeSection/role
  S-->>A: derived visible nav and widgets
  A->>P: render section-specific panels

  U->>T: Select drone marker
  T->>S: selectDrone(id)
  S-->>T: selected drone state
  S-->>P: selected drone details

  loop Demo simulation tick
    S->>M: simulateTick(currentState)
    M-->>S: updated positions/statuses
    S-->>T: refreshed markers/routes
    S-->>P: refreshed alerts/KPIs
  end
